35,2,1,talk,Mio,,The transport costs are shocking. They are nearly a third of the installation budget.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Victoria,,The conservation lab is down to one person. The backlog is two hundred pieces.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shion,,Head counts drop in static rooms. People come back for live demonstrations.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Asuka,,The suspended bay can only hold four hundred kilos per square metre.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shizue,,Two recent openings slipped because paperwork arrived after the shipping cut-off.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Asuka, that weight limit is a major constraint for heavy loans.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Mio, yes, and with only one conservator, we cannot process new loans quickly.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Victoria, that explains why the static shows failed. We need activity.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, activity often means powered displays, which have high maintenance logs.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, the mounting costs are also rising. Bespoke mounts are expensive.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mio,,"@Shizue, I see. So we need something that doesn't require heavy custom mounts.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Shion, the volunteer roster is mostly the town history circle. They are good for talks.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shion,,"@Victoria, that fits. They can provide the ""presence"" visitors want.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Shizue, the evening hires damage open arrangements. We need something secure.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Asuka, agreed. We need to avoid things that can be easily damaged or lost.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mio,,"So, we need a show that is light, secure, and has live elements.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Victoria,,And one that our current staff can actually manage.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Shion,,And one that people will actually want to return to.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Asuka,,And one that fits the structural limits of the main gallery.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Shizue,,And one that won't get stuck in shipping or paperwork.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
