60,3,1,talk,Mio,,"Candidate A, Textiles, seems light and allows for demonstrations.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Victoria,,Candidate A fits our staffing. The town history circle can help with interviews.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
