65,3,2,talk,Mio,,"Candidate B, Light and Motion, is risky. Powered displays have high maintenance.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Victoria,,Candidate B requires technical staff we do not have.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Shion,,"Candidate B is interesting, but the comment slips say people want people, not just lights.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Asuka,,Candidate B has overhead rigging. That is a structural risk.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Shizue,,Candidate B involves complex shipping. High risk of delay.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
