74,3,3,talk,Shizue,,Candidate C involves distant lenders. High risk of paperwork delays.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Mio,,"Candidate D, City Under Excavation, has a conservation bench. That is a problem.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Victoria,,Candidate D requires active conservation. We are too understaffed.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Shion,,"Candidate D is interesting, but the ""working bench"" might not be safe for visitors.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Asuka,,Candidate D has reconstructions. Heavy. Structural risk.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Shizue,,Candidate D involves recent digs. Paperwork might be complex.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
